{"title":"广东：“挂证”查询系统正式开通！","date":"2024-10-15","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">广东：&ldquo;挂证&rdquo;查询系统正式开通！<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">10</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>日，广东省住建厅发布通知，<b>开通&ldquo;挂证&rdquo;专项治理系统，可以查询是否存在&ldquo;挂证&rdquo;情况</b>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">近日，广东省建设执业资注册格服务平台发布《关于调整强制注销业务办理方式的通知》。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"circle\">\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n     mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:\r\n     16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">从<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>日起，可线上办理一级注册建造师、二级注册建造师、二级注册结构工程师、二级注册建筑师、二级注册造价工程师强制注销注册业务，无需提交书面材料。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:\r\ninter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">9</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">月，广东省住建厅、人社厅联合发布《关于开展工程建设领域专业技术人员违规&ldquo;挂证&rdquo;行为专项治理的通知》。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"circle\">\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\n     mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\">\r\n\t\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">11</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">月起全面排查&ldquo;挂证&rdquo;，</span></b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">对本地区工程建设领域专业技术人员进行全面比对排查，重点核查注册单位与社保缴纳、住房公积金缴存单位不一致等情况。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}